{"title":"2021 ZeMC10 Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_ZeMC10_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given that Luke's teachers assign homework at the same constant rate, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> teachers can assign <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa4de95cc6371d125d5cf773cdd9f9913dd1d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> homework assignments to Luke in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hour, how many homework assignments can <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> teacher assign to Luke in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/a/68af21466f13097cf9eafb87439886ce205b0b65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 10 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 12 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 15 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 120  \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 600$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"419\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018020530\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: